d","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":442,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1989-1219-036%2C_Berlin%2C_Demonstration_gegen_Wiedervereinigung.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":442},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1989-1219-036%2C_Berlin%2C_Demonstration_gegen_Wiedervereinigung.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1989-1219-036,_Berlin,_Demonstration_gegen_Wiedervereinigung.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=5347710","extmetadata":{"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q113144755\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q113144755\"><span title=\"German photographer and photo journalist\">Hubert Link</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<div style=\"background:var(--background-color-neutral, #eaecf0); color:inherit; font-size:86%; direction:ltr;\">For documentary purposes the German Federal Archive often retained the <b>original image captions</b>, which may be <b>erroneous, biased, obsolete or politically extreme</b>. <abbr class=\"BArchtooltips\" title=\"Files from the inventories \u201cBild 101 Propagandakompanien der Wehrmacht\u201d and \u201cBild 183 ADN\u201d may have particularly biased or politically extreme descriptions.\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Info_non-talk.svg/20px-Info_non-talk.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Info_non-talk.svg/40px-Info_non-talk.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"62\" data-file-height=\"62\"></span></span></abbr></div><div class=\"language de\"><b>Berlin, Demonstration gegen Wiedervereinigung</b>\nADN-ZB Link 19.12.89 Berlin: Demo gegen Wiedervereinigung- F\u00fcr den Erhalt der Souver\u00e4nit\u00e4t der DDR, gegen Ausverkauf und Wiedervereinigung demonstrierten Tausende Berliner anl\u00e4\u00dflich des Kohl-Besuches in der DDR in der Hauptstadt. Die Demonstrantion begann auf dem Alexanderplatz und endete mit einer Kundgebung auf dem Platz der Akademie.</div></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 3.0 de","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"5425897":{"pageid":5425897,"ns":6,"title":"File:Bundesarchiv Bild 183-1990-0930-300, Berlin, BVG-Doppelstockbusse.jpg","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":99713,"width":785,"height":541,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-0930-300%2C_Berlin%2C_BVG-Doppelstockbusse.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":441,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-0930-300%2C_Berlin%2C_BVG-Doppelstockbusse.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":441},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-0930-300%2C_Berlin%2C_BVG-Doppelstockbusse.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-0930-300,_Berlin,_BVG-Doppelstockbusse.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=5425897","extmetadata":{"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q112939733\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q112939733\"><span title=\"German photographer\">Klaus Franke</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<div style=\"background:var(--background-color-neutral, #eaecf0); color:inherit; font-size:86%; direction:ltr;\">For documentary purposes the German Federal Archive often retained the <b>original image captions</b>, which may be <b>erroneous, biased, obsolete or politically extreme</b>. <abbr class=\"BArchtooltips\" title=\"Files from the inventories \u201cBild 101 Propagandakompanien der Wehrmacht\u201d and \u201cBild 183 ADN\u201d may have particularly biased or politically extreme descriptions.\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Info_non-talk.svg/20px-Info_non-talk.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Info_non-talk.svg/40px-Info_non-talk.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"62\" data-file-height=\"62\"></span></span></abbr></div><div class=\"language de\">ADN-ZB-Franke-30.9.90-bt-Berlin: Seit heute fahren sie wieder im Ostteil der Stadt. Ehemalige BVG-Doppelstockbusse werden erstmals auf den Routen 59, 70 und 89 der BVB im Liniendienst eingesetzt.</div></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 3.0 de","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"5425926":{"pageid":5425926,"ns":6,"title":"File:Bundesarchiv Bild 183-1990-1003-036, Berlin, Demonstration gegen Wiedervereinigung.jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":87206,"width":786,"height":537,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-1003-036%2C_Berlin%2C_Demonstration_gegen_Wiedervereinigung.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":437,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-1003-036%2C_Berlin%2C_Demonstration_gegen_Wiedervereinigung.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":437},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-1003-036%2C_Berlin%2C_Demonstration_gegen_Wiedervereinigung.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-1003-036,_Berlin,_Demonstration_gegen_Wiedervereinigung.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=5425926","extmetadata":{"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q98768504\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q98768504\"><span title=\"German photographer\">Bernd Settnik</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<div style=\"background:var(--background-color-neutral, #eaecf0); color:inherit; font-size:86%; direction:ltr;\">For documentary purposes the German Federal Archive often retained the <b>original image captions</b>, which may be <b>erroneous, biased, obsolete or politically extreme</b>. <abbr class=\"BArchtooltips\" title=\"Files from the inventories \u201cBild 101 Propagandakompanien der Wehrmacht\u201d and \u201cBild 183 ADN\u201d may have particularly biased or politically extreme descriptions.\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Info_non-talk.svg/20px-Info_non-talk.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Info_non-talk.svg/40px-Info_non-talk.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"62\" data-file-height=\"62\"></span></span></abbr></div><div class=\"language de\">ADN-Bernd Settnik-3.10.90 Berlin: Vereinigung. Unter dem Motto \"Deutschland - halts Maul\" demonstrierten in der Innenstadt mehr als 10.000 Jugendliche gegen die deutsche Wiedervereinigung.</div></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 3.0 de","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"5425932":{"pageid":5425932,"ns":6,"title":"File:Bundesarchiv Bild 183-1990-1004-016, Strausberg, erster Appell Bundeswehrkommando Ost.jpg","index":6,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":64335,"width":800,"height":568,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-1004-016%2C_Strausberg%2C_erster_Appell_Bundeswehrkommando_Ost.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":454,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-1004-016%2C_Strausberg%2C_erster_Appell_Bundeswehrkommando_Ost.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":454},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-1004-016%2C_Strausberg%2C_erster_Appell_Bundeswehrkommando_Ost.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-1990-1004-016,_Strausberg,_erster_Appell_Bundeswehrkommando_Ost.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?cu